# =============================================================================
# 根目录白名单 (Root Directory Whitelist)
# 先忽略根目录下所有文件/目录 (/*), 再用 !/ 显式放行需要跟踪的条目
# 效果: agent 在根目录新建的任何脚本/文件都会被自动忽略, 不会被误提交
# 如需新增根目录文件入库, 必须在此处显式添加 !/文件名
# =============================================================================
/*
# Git 元数据 (始终跟踪)
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitignore
!/.gitmodules
# CI/CD
!/.github
# 项目配置
!/.clang-tidy
!/CMake
!/CMakeLists.txt
# 构建脚本 (入库)
!/build-debug-asan.sh
!/build_fx2lafw.sh
!/build_linux.sh
!/build_macos.sh
!/build_windows.sh
# 源码目录
!/PXView
!/common
!/debian
!/doc
!/lang
!/libsigrok
!/libsigrokdecode
!/libusb
!/pxview-automation
!/python
!/sigrok-firmware
!/sigrok-firmware-fx2lafw
!/sigrok-util
!/tests
!/tools
!/web
!/window
# 项目文件
!/COPYING
!/INSTALL.md
!/INSTALL_zh.md
!/LICENSE
!/PXView.icns
!/README.md
!/applogo.rc
!/logo-win.ico
!/mac_appbundle_template.plist.in
!/window_nisi.nsi
!/windows.md
!/更新说明.txt

# Build directories
build/
build-qt6/
build.dir/
install.dir/
install-qt6.dir/
package/
# CMake generated files
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
CPackConfig.cmake
CPackSourceConfig.cmake
Makefile
compile_commands.json
CTestTestfile.cmake
_deps

# Ninja
.ninja_deps
.ninja_log
build.ninja

# Qt generated files
moc_*.cpp
moc_*.h
ui_*.h
qrc_*.cpp
*.qrc.depends

# Compiled Object files
*.slo
*.lo
*.o
*.obj

# Precompiled Headers
*.gch
*.pch

# Compiled Dynamic libraries
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll

# Compiled Static libraries
*.lai
*.la
*.a
*.lib

# Executables
*.exe
*.out
*.app

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# IDE / Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
.trae/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.kate-swp
*.kdev4

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# Backup files
*.bak
* - 副本.*
* - 副本

# Autotools
/configure
/configure.lineno
/autom4te.cache/
/aclocal.m4
/Makefile.in
/INSTALL
/libtool
/stamp-h?
.deps/
.dirstamp
.libs/

# Test logs
/test-suite.log
*.log
*.trs

# =============================================================================
# 私有内容(开发仓库独有,不推送到开源仓库)
# 文件保留在工作区原位置,仅从 git 跟踪移除
# =============================================================================
Reference/

# 开发规范文档
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# 私有文档(顶部)
PXLogic使用文档.docx

# 开发脚本(顶部) - 旧脚本,不同步到开源仓库
build_full.cmd
build_incremental.cmd
build_incremental.sh
build_window
build_window_noall
build_mac.sh
build_mac_icon.sh
build_linux
build_deb_package
clean
cmake_clear

# 新构建脚本同步到开源仓库 (不在 .gitignore 中):
# build_linux.sh, build_macos.sh, build_windows.sh, build_fx2lafw.sh

# 同步/迁移脚本(旧双仓库模式,已废弃,单仓库模式不再需要)
sync_to_repo.cmd
sync_to_repo.ps1
sync_to_opensource.ps1
sync_to_package.ps1
sync_to_wsl.cmd
sync_opensource.ps1
migrate_to_worktree.ps1

# 版本/生成/迁移辅助脚本(开发辅助,不入库)
bump_version.ps1
generate_8b10b.py
scripts/migrate_driver.py

# 开发文档目录(含分析报告、临时 cpp、分析脚本等)
devdoc/

# 补丁文件目录
_diffs/

# Windows 打包二进制资源 (python embed dll/zip)
# package.sh, copy-deps.sh 等脚本文件已纳入 git 跟踪
window/python/

# 私有文档(doc/ 和 docs/ 下的私有文件,精确排除)
doc/PXLogic使用文档v1.5.0.pdf
docs/研究报告-pxlogic-dslogic数据格式转换分析.md

# 逆向工程参考目录(指向旧包软链接)
BFA_Reference/

# 私有逆向解码器源码与文档
libsigrokdecode/c_decoders_private/
doc/private_protocols/

# 顶层 Python 运行时二进制 (嵌入版 python 3.14, 不应入库, 本地文件保留)
# 仅忽略二进制运行时; 文本文件(LICENSE.txt/python314._pth/python.cat)仍保留追踪
python/*.pyd
python/*.dll
python/*.exe
python/*.zip

# IDE 本地数据 (CodeBuddy 工作区数据, 绝不入库)
.codebuddy/

# Windows 资源管理器残留文件
desktop.ini
